Fri Nov 20 06:17:32 UTC 2026 - Bernhard M. Wiedemann <bwiedemann@suse.de>

- Make the build reproducible:
  * drop npm's hidden node_modules/.package-lock.json from the staged
    server resources; its resolved URLs carried the ephemeral localhost
    port of the offline registry proxy.
  * backport the embedded-asset determinism half of tauri PR #15777
    (tauri-codegen 2.7.0) into the vendored tauri-codegen 2.5.5
    (codenomad-deterministic-csp-hashes.patch): the CSP hash list baked
    into the binary was emitted in file system directory order.

