Sat Oct 31 18:33:14 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Recommend git-core for the repo/worktree features,
  trim source maps and upstream test files from the
  staged resources, re-derive License over the shipped
  trees, and check the shipped crate like upstream CI does.
- Add codenomad-wayland-default.patch: default to native Wayland
  instead of upstream's X11-first GTK pin, with the
  StartupWMClass aligned to the application ID.
- Add codenomad-no-pwa-assets.patch: drop the PWA pwaAssets
  icon generation, the only sharp consumer, and delete the
  sharp/libvips Linux binaries from the vendored tarballs.
  Cost: the generated PWA icons are gone from the build
  output; smoke check and Windows toast use static logo.png.
- Build esbuild 0.21.5 + 0.25.12 from source in %build
  (new Sources 20-22) and delete the 4 prebuilt platform
  binaries from the vendored tarballs.
- Build the rollup 4.52.5 NAPI binding from source in %build
  (new Sources 23-24) and delete the 2 prebuilt .node files
  from the vendored tarballs.
- Add missing BuildRequires: cmake for the vendored cmake
  build scripts (rollup NAPI, mimalloc).

